---
import GarmentStudy from "./GarmentStudy.astro";
---

<figure class="m-0 overflow-hidden rounded-[1.25rem] border border-line bg-surface shadow-[0_24px_100px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)]">
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-line px-5 py-4 text-xs">
    <span class="font-semibold">한 벌을 위한 작업대</span>
    <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-muted">
      <span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      촬영 기획 예시
    </span>
  </div>
  <div class="p-4 sm:p-5">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-[0.85fr_1.15fr] gap-3 sm:gap-4">
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-[#eeeae1]">
        <p class="px-4 pt-4 text-[10px] font-semibold text-[#55564f]">
          원본 사진
        </p>
        <div class="h-56 sm:h-72 lg:h-80">
          <GarmentStudy />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-line bg-studio">
        <p class="absolute top-4 left-4 text-[10px] font-semibold text-muted">
          원하는 장면
        </p>
        <svg
          viewBox="0 0 260 380"
          class="h-56 w-full sm:h-72 lg:h-80"
          role="img"
          aria-labelledby="scene-study-title"
        >
          <title id="scene-study-title">창가에 선 성인 모델의 촬영 콘셉트를 표현한 설명용 그림</title>
          <path
            d="M27 0v301m-5-204h48m-48 69h48m-48 68h48"
            stroke="var(--color-line)"
            fill="none"
          />
          <path d="M32 0h40v302H32" fill="var(--color-surface)" opacity=".4" />
          <path d="m72 302 188 57M72 302H0" stroke="var(--color-line)" />
          <ellipse cx="152" cy="346" rx="47" ry="8" fill="var(--color-paper)" />
          <path
            d="m129 225-5 104 18 2 11-77 4 78 18-2-4-106"
            fill="var(--color-control)"
          />
          <path
            d="m124 329-8 13q10 6 26 0v-12m15 1v12q18 6 29-1l-12-13"
            fill="var(--color-muted)"
          />
          <path d="M138 86v20l16 9 14-12-7-21" fill="#bcb4a7" />
          <path
            d="M132 47q22-14 37 7l1 25q-8 23-25 14l-13-18Z"
            fill="#c9c1b4"
          />
          <path
            d="M128 63q-5-25 14-29 24-4 31 20l-2 17-9-20-22 2-10 14"
            fill="var(--color-paper)"
          />
          <path
            d="m137 103-29 14-23 83 14 6 21-53-1 76q29 12 61-2l-5-77 24 53 13-7-27-80-23-13-12 17Z"
            fill="#ded8ca"
            stroke="#aaa496"
            stroke-width=".7"
          />
          <path
            d="m137 103 13 17-10 12-11-24m33-5-12 17 12 11 8-25m-20 14v112m-22-18-4-43m49 43-3-46"
            fill="none"
            stroke="#aaa496"
            stroke-width=".8"
          />
          <path
            d="m85 200-3 18 10 6 7-18m100-3 4 18 11-7-2-18"
            fill="#c9c1b4"
          />
          <path
            d="m162 145 12-1 1 16-6 3-7-3Z"
            fill="none"
            stroke="#aaa496"
            stroke-width=".8"
          />
          <g fill="#aaa496">
            <circle cx="151" cy="150" r="1.3" />
            <circle cx="151" cy="173" r="1.3" />
            <circle cx="151" cy="196" r="1.3" />
          </g>
          <path
            d="M95 82h-8V69m111 0h13v13M87 255v13h12m100 0h12v-13"
            stroke="var(--color-primary)"
            opacity=".5"
            fill="none"
          />
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-[11px] text-muted">
      <span class="rounded-md bg-studio px-3 py-2">부드러운 창가 빛</span>
      <span class="rounded-md bg-studio px-3 py-2">자연스러운 소재</span>
      <span class="ml-auto py-2 text-primary" aria-hidden="true">
        원본과 나란히 ↗
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="border-t border-line px-5 py-3 text-[10px] leading-5 text-muted">
    설명용 일러스트이며 실제 AI 생성 결과가 아닙니다.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
